Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.96,0:01:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Seduto!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.19,0:01:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Quanto tempo!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.62,0:01:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Ciao zii, bello rivedervi!
