Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.72,0:01:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Dov'è il nonno?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.95,0:01:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Nell'orto.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.24,0:01:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Nonno!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.04,0:01:42.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Mi sei mancata tantissimo!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.69,0:01:42.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Ahi, ma pungi!
